ingest pulls calendar events up to a year ahead (\code{events_days_forward}).
\item \strong{\code{alt_tenant_join_url}} -- the \code{join_url} does not carry the own tenant's
GUID, so the meeting was created in the previous tenant. Its attendance
report is unreachable app-only; \code{discover_meetings_from_events} filters those
meetings out by the same rule, which is why no call ever arrives for them.
Recurring series created before the tenant migration keep their original
\code{join_url} indefinitely, so this does not age out on its own.
